    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d34">

                <pb facs="0122" n="46" xml:id="pg46"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">842.801/118: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Canada</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Robbins</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-02-19T18:00:00-05:00">February 19, 1935—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>13. Your despatch No. 1079, February 15. An instruction in reply must be delayed
                    pending further consideration as to the detailed effect of the proposal. The
                    speedy cooperation of other Departments is being obtained. You may reply to the
                    Prime Minister in this sense.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
